{"id":"belleza","lemma":"belleza","pos":"noun","rank":1095,"glosses":["beauty (the quality of being beautiful)","beauty (beautiful person or object)"],"ipa":"/beˈʝeθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bellezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-belleza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella es una belleza.","en":"She's a beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442006","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La belleza no es importante.","en":"Beauty isn't important.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460880","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"important"}]},{"text":"La belleza está en los ojos del que mira.","en":"Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1579","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"eye","l":"ojo"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"target"}]},{"text":"Su hermana es una auténtica belleza.","en":"His sister is a real beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639946","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"sister"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"authentic, real, true","l":"auténtico"},null]},{"text":"Su belleza se ajará con el tiempo.","en":"Her beauty will fade in time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641860","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"oneself"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"over time"]]}]}